WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.650
grece hydroponics. Animated system walkthrough of the documented flow. Drawn from the repository code, last updated in 2024. Sample readings, no hardware footage.

2
00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:04.750
pH and EC circuits on I2C, read by an Arduino Uno

3
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.550
The Uno prints one serial line per read cycle

4
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.150
A BLE tag adds temperature and humidity at the Raspberry Pi

5
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.250
The Pi posts JSON to a Django REST API that stores every reading

6
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:15.350
The real API, running locally: post one sample reading

7
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.050
201 Created: the reading is stored

8
00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:19.900
Every reading stays in the log, ready for tuning

9
00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:22.600
grece hydroponics. Walkthrough of the code plus its real API running locally. Readings are samples.

